# Large media assets -- exceed or approach GitHub's 100MB per-file limit and
# don't belong in git history. Host these as GitHub Release assets instead
# (Releases -> Draft a new release -> attach binaries) or via Git LFS.
Dynamic_Elo.pptx.pdf
demo.mp4
PPT.pptx

# Generated reports (data/reports/*.xlsx, including the dashboard) ARE kept
# in version control on purpose -- they're small (a few hundred KB total)
# and let a repo visitor see real results without running the pipeline.
# Re-run baseline.py / dynamic.py / build_dashboard.py to refresh them.
